1. User Registration
As a new user, I want to create an account using my name, email, and password so that I can access the library services online.

2. User Login
As a registered user, I want to log in using my credentials so that I can access my library account.

3. Search Books
As a user, I want to search for books using the book title or author name so that I can quickly find the book I need.

4. View Book Details
As a user, I want to view the details of a book so that I can know its author, category, and availability.

5. Borrow a Book
As a registered user, I want to borrow an available book so that I can read it for a specific period.

6. Return a Book
As a user, I must return the borrowed book before the due date so that I can avoid late return penalties.

7. Renew a Book
As a user, I want to renew a borrowed book so that I can keep it for a longer period.

8. Reserve a Book
As a user, I want to reserve an unavailable book so that I can borrow it when it becomes available.

9. View Borrowing History
As a registered user, I want to view my borrowing history so that I can keep track of the books I have borrowed.

10. Check Due Date
As a user, I want to check the due date of my borrowed books so that I can return them on time.

11. Logout
As a logged-in user, I want to log out of my account so that my library account remains secure.
